OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to demolish remains of
OL,4,Ahistorical bath house
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been put forward to demolish
OL,7,Fwhat remains of a 19th Century bath
OL,8,Fhouse in a town's conservation area.
OL,10,FBritain's Energy Coast (BEC) West
OL,11,FCumbria has applied to Cumberland
OL,12,FCouncil for permission to knock down
OL,13,FWhitehaven's Bath House, on the corner
OL,14,Fof Duke Street and the harbour's
OL,15,Fpromenade.
OL,17,FIn planning documents, the company said
OL,18,Fit wanted to demolish the building "on
OL,19,Fthe grounds of public safety" and a
OL,20,Fredevelopment proposal would follow
OL,21,F"once there is a clearer understanding
OL,22,Fof the potential occupier and scheme".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
